    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "# BASH - Official Game Rules\n\n## \U0001F3AF Objective\nSurvival is the
    name of the game. The **last player remaining with an undestroyed piece** is
    the winner!\n\n---\n\n## \U0001F3AE Controls & Turn Mechanics\n* **Action/Attack:**
    Hold the **Left Trigger** to initiate your piece's attack (either firing a projectile
    or executing a ramming maneuver).\n* **Steer Projectile:** Use the **Right Joystick**
    to adjust your path mid-flight (whether shooting a missile, ramming, or moving).\n*
    **Defenseless Targets:** There are no defensive mechanics. Opponents remain stationary
    during your turn while you execute your attack.\n\n---\n\n## \u265F\uFE0F The
    Pieces: Abilities & Movement\n\nEach piece has a unique way of moving, attacking,
    and navigating the map. \n\n### \U0001F6E5\uFE0F Boat\n* **Turn Sequence:** Fires
    an arcing shot **first**, and then moves.\n* **Combat:** To destroy an opponent,
    your arcing shot *must* land directly on them. Ramming or bumping into an opponent
    during your movement phase does nothing.\n* **Navigation:** **Cannot** move onto
    islands. **Cannot** move through or hit walls and bases.\n\n### \u2708\uFE0F
    Airplane\n* **Turn Sequence:** Fires an arcing shot **first**, and then moves.\n*
    **Combat:** Just like the boat, your arcing shot *must* land directly on an opponent
    to destroy them. You cannot destroy opponents by crashing into them during movement.\n*
    **Navigation:** **Can** move onto and fly over islands. **Cannot** move through
    walls or bases.\n\n### \u26F4\uFE0F Submarine\n* **Turn Sequence:** Moves and
    attacks simultaneously in a single turn. \n* **Combat:** Ramming only! It does
    not fire projectiles. If your movement path goes directly through an opponent,
    they are instantly destroyed.\n* **Navigation:** **Cannot** move through islands,
    walls, or bases.\n\n### \U0001F681 Helicopter\n* **Turn Sequence:** Moves and
    attacks simultaneously in a single turn.\n* **Combat:** Ramming only! Like the
    Submarine, it does not fire projectiles. You must move directly through an opponent
    to destroy them.\n* **Navigation:** **Can** move freely over and through islands.
    **Cannot** move through walls or bases.\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
